<title>UK: BfG Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up Sept 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>BfG Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up Sept 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BFG HYOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.25	MATURITY   *12.SEP.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.85    PAY DATE    12.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    FFURT     DENOMS (K)  10</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC   1.75</p>
<p> NOTES     *UNTIL 12.SEP.97 THEN STEPS-UP TO 4.75 PERCENT IF</p>
<p>		NOT CALLED.</p>
<p>		HYPOTHEKENBANK PFANDBRIEF REIHE 94</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
